\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Representative setup for the inclusion study. a) Full computational domain, including the resolved material region with circular inclusions and the surrounding effective medium. b) Final phase-field pattern for one stored simulation, plotted with a blue-to-red scale for the phase field \(s\). c) Corresponding triangular finite-element mesh. The shown simulation has \(w_s=1.0L\), \(k_{\rm  inc}=0.5\), and \(G_{c,\rm  inc}=0.5G_c^0\).}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:setup_inclusions}{{2}{6}{Representative setup for the inclusion study. a) Full computational domain, including the resolved material region with circular inclusions and the surrounding effective medium. b) Final phase-field pattern for one stored simulation, plotted with a blue-to-red scale for the phase field \(s\). c) Corresponding triangular finite-element mesh. The shown simulation has \(w_s=1.0L\), \(\Kinc =0.5\), and \(\Gcinc =0.5\GcZero \)}{figure.2}{}}
